  m_Name: Magic Damage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Description: "A magic blow, as every magic blow of the Demo's goes: harder by its dealer's Magic Amplification, as 1 + it, then lessened by its target's Magic Resistance, 1 \u2212 it going through, the resistance kept between 0 and 1, so 0.25 takes a quarter off and a Hex below 0 adds nothing"
